  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Description:\nIf you apply/wear a large avatar/skin it breaks the game. The popup menu for changing your avatar, world's, etc becomes non-responsive. You can still click the buttons at the top (avatar, world's, settings, etc) but selecting skins or worlds is non-responsive. Leaving you completely stuck.\nRepro Steps: Change into a stupidly large avatar/skin, close menu, open menu, try and change avatar or world.\nA quick Google shows I'm.not the only one to experience this issue with the Oculus Quest version, and talking to people in game, they have said they've experienced it as well.",
